# A block starting and due on the same day next week is listed once in Upcoming.
file <<END
- Same day @start({today+1}) @due({today+1})
- Next @due({today+2})
END
keys gU
see ▌ - Same day
keys j
see ▌ - Next
keys k
see ▌ - Same day
keys j j x
quit
saved <<END
- Same day @start({today+1}) @due({today+1})
- Next @due({today+2}) @done({today})
END
